---
const includes = [
  "Full Body Assessment",
  "Manual Therapy",
  "Personalized Plan",
  "Corrective Exercises",
]
---

<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white text-black">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
    <div class="order-2 md:order-1 max-w-xl">
      <p class="text-[24px] font-medium mb-4 leading-snug">From whole-body assessments to manual therapy, your first visit is all about getting to the root of what's going on.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-[48px] font-bold leading-tight">Your First Myo Session</h2>
        <span class="text-[12px] px-3 py-1 border border-black rounded-full font-bold shrink-0 uppercase">60 MINS</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#333333] mb-8">Your first session is dedicated to understanding your body's unique needs. You'll work one-on-one with a skilled clinician who will listen, assess, and create a personalized plan to help you move and feel better.</p>
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Your treatment includes:</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
        {includes.map((item) => (
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-base font-bold">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            {item}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-8">
        <a href="/book" class="inline-flex bg-black text-white px-8 py-6 h-auto rounded-full font-bold text-base hover:bg-black/90 transition-colors uppercase tracking-wide">BOOK A SESSION</a>
        <a href="#" class="font-bold underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity uppercase tracking-wide">See Inside A Session</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="order-1 md:order-2 w-full">
      <div class="relative aspect-[1.1/1] md:aspect-[0.9/1] lg:aspect-[1.1/1] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        <img src="/images/assets/67e7f478ad9a5c8ee0b9027e_first-myo-session.avif" alt="Your First Myo Session" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
